From 3df6d1d842cbf694213b9e6099e2d6c81f22d75f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 03:59:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] generic-parallel: fixes of the review of the contract of the
 behaviours

- cuda and hip backends of the behaviours: more blocks of threads than the
  grid of the device can hold is an invalid argument (`-5`), as for the
  material properties, instead of a truncated grid;
- report functions (behaviours, models, material properties) and batch
  functions of the material properties: a null output status gives `-5`;
- report function of the behaviours: keys whose check is not null (which do
  not come from a behaviour) give `-5`;
- tests: `--time-step-scaling-factor` option of the comparison of the
  behaviours, used with failures at some points, so that the first
  unreliable result of a batch is checked;
- documentation: names of the functions of batches in the example, `-5`.
---
 docs/web/generic-parallel-behaviour-interface.md | 12 +++++++-----
 ...neric-parallel-material-property-interface.md |  3 ++-
 .../MFront/GenericParallelBehaviour/GPU.hxx      |  7 +++++++
 .../GenericParallelBehaviour/Integrate.hxx       | 14 ++++++++++++++
 .../MaterialProperty/BackendBase.cxx             | 10 ++++++++--
 mfront/src/GenericParallelBehaviourInterface.cxx |  3 +++
 .../behaviours/generic-parallel/compare-all.sh   |  5 +++++
 .../behaviours/generic-parallel/compare.cxx      | 16 +++++++++++++---
 8 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

